# Pairs with NonDisclosure. The enforcer before #6231: a refused crossing
# said whether the owning tenant was registered, so a member of any tenant
# could enumerate tenants by reading their trees.
MODULE: ReadReasonNamesUnregisteredOwner
TARGET: NonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a refused crossing reports an unregistered owning tenant apart from a missing grant
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
        crossingReason == "crossing"
--- REPLACE
        crossingReason == IF status["A"] = "active" THEN "crossing" ELSE "ownerUnregistered"
--- END